# sgo.build (schema: see core/sgo.build). wata-fb is an APP over core + json +
# wataclient (the portable client core) that rides a cgo Go dep (go-pkgs/audio,
# static opus/tinyalsa libs on a cgo cross-build).
mode app
emitname wata-fb
binname wata-fb
gomod watafb
optreport
godep github.com/adriaanm/wata/go-pkgs/audio go-pkgs/audio cgo
